1
00:00:00,233 --> 00:00:02,403
...these cultures
and my accompanying notes...

2
00:00:02,568 --> 00:00:04,818
(Sheldon:)...will give them a fighting chance.

3
00:00:08,908 --> 00:00:10,698
(Leonard:)I'm going back to bed.

4
00:00:10,868 --> 00:00:13,828
- Wait, put this in the bathroom.
- What for?

5
00:00:13,996 --> 00:00:16,166
(Sheldon:)I need to measure
my fluid intake and output...

6
00:00:16,332 --> 00:00:18,582
(Sheldon:)...to make sure
my kidneys aren't shutting down.

7
00:00:20,336 --> 00:00:23,586
(Leonard:)I mix pancake batter in this.

8
00:00:24,090 --> 00:00:27,300
(Sheldon:)No, that measuring cup
has always been for urine.

9
00:00:28,511 --> 00:00:31,221
(Leonard:)You had time to make a label
for everything in this apartment...

10
00:00:31,389 --> 00:00:32,849
...including the label-maker...

11
00:00:33,015 --> 00:00:36,645
...but you didn't have 10 seconds
to make one that said, "Urine cup"?

12
00:00:38,187 --> 00:00:40,397
(Sheldon:)It's right here on the bottom.

13
00:00:44,110 --> 00:00:45,490
(Leonard:)Huh.

14
00:00:47,405 --> 00:00:51,035
(Leonard:)I guess I owe the Betty Crocker Company
a letter of apology.

15
00:00:53,244 --> 00:01:07,024
[COUGHING]

